// Mirelo Sales - DAX query view tests (bip, generated 2026-10-27 from data/mirelo_sales_dummy_data/checks/control_totals_eur.csv).
// How to run: Power BI Desktop > DAX query view > paste one EVALUATE block > Run. Every row's _pass must be TRUE.
// The window is set the way the report sets it (2026-11-02, change 11): the picked months on the disconnected calendar
// param_anchor_month (a FILTER on month_index; the older blocks still name the window MONTH / QTD / YTD / R12M + anchor and
// turn it into that month range) and param_market (ALL / PL / RO / PT). FY2025 = Jan-Dec 2025.
// Tolerances: EUR 0.011 (control totals are rounded to cents), ratios 0.000001 (6 decimals), counts exact.
// Sets:
//   T-M1  requested windows: Sep 2026, FY2025, FY2026 YTD Sep x ALL / PL / RO / PT x 16 metrics (192 rows)
//   T-M2  every closed month Jan 2024 - Sep 2026 x 4 markets x 16 metrics (2112 rows)
//   T-M3  QTD / YTD / R12M windows = sum of the monthly control values, additive metrics (192 rows; EUR tolerance 0.005 per month summed)
//   T-M4  bridge identity and README rule 2 (8 rows)
//   T-M5  smoke: card SVGs and 13-month trends (56 rows)
//   T-M6  ADR-0012 info lookup: title + definition per dim_card row, note per card (59 rows)
//   T-M7  2026-11-01 owner changes: KPI vs Budget + vs PY rows and chip fallback (64 rows) (T-M7b replaced by T-M8a)
//   T-M8  2026-11-02 owner changes rounds 2-4 (changes 11-33): calendar filter line / Showing / Reset (33), free ranges
//         (24), C5 (37), L8 + C8 funnels (19), C11 (14), R11 (5), P13 (16), heat matrices (65), drill row counts (6),
//         leaderboard rank + P12 + model health (57: one row per agent code since 2026-11-02)
//   T-M9  2026-11-02 Power BI = JS fix-up: the five tables cell by cell, titles, L13 order, filter / Showing lines for five
//         selections (337), list window titles (5), ⓘ titles + sub-values (58), heat cells L10 / P9 / C9 (170)
//   T-P   parity rows vs Track C: 13 selections, 833 rows (parity-check-2026-10-27 section 3; the 25 c5 rows re-seeded
//         2026-11-02 from nerd's rows, source engine-c 2026-11-02: C5 = returning-client approval rate)
// Budget comparisons have no control totals (the generator publishes actuals only); they are not reconciled here.

// T-M1 requested windows: Sep 2026, FY2025, FY2026 YTD Sep (192 rows)
